        "title": "Temple is located near the Cremation site on river",
        "text": "Pashupatinath Temple and Cremation Site along a river near Kathmandu, Nepal...part of the Hindu tradition is for the body to be cremated after death...many bodies were being burned when I arrived at the holy site...strange idea for me being a westerner cause we are not so open about dealing with death in my country....I am thinking this is more healthy cause we are all destined to be a part of this ritual in some form or another...the older I grow, the closer I am towards my death. the more in touch I am with my body dropping away at some point...seems not so scary any longer...part of the natural process of life...but I wonder how I will be when the day, the moment finally comes when it is time to go...to leave the body I am so friendly with...so accustomed too for all of these years...I am hoping it is peaceful and I am truly ready for the transition",
        "review_tip": null,
